      "offset_meters": -0.10795,
      "note": "Hanging-tab center-to-center spacing follows the hanger width so the tab stays seated in the slot on a width resize. The hanger's two slots are cut a fixed inset (2.125 in) in from each side edge, so slot spacing = hanger_width - 4.25 in; the tab spacing is linked to match. offset = tab_spacing - hanger_width = 254.0 - 361.95 mm = -107.95 mm (-4.25 in). Fires only when the hanger width is among a turn's changes (i.e. width resizes), so it is automatically axis-correct."
    }
